<item><title>Niger reopens Niamey Grand Market shops as rent talks continue</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-reopens-niamey-grand-market-shops-as-rent-talks-5bdde1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-reopens-niamey-grand-market-shops-as-rent-talks-5bdde1/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>The government has ordered an immediate restart after nearly two weeks of disrupted trade, without overturning the court-backed rent revision.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:50:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-reopens-niamey-grand-market-shops-as-rent-talks-5bdde1/share.jpg" length="43082" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/niger-reopens-niamey-grand-market-shops-as-rent-talks-5bdde1/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
